Zeta3.SuperV.super_v_seven : ∀ (m : ℕ),
  1 ≤ m → m < 7 → Zeta3.SuperV.PCongPow 7 3 (7 ^ 3 * Zeta3.SuperV.aperyV (7 * m)) (Zeta3.SuperV.aperyV m)
Zeta3.SuperV.super_v_seven_pred : ∀ (m : ℕ),
